      "quote": "29 March 2023",
      "gist": "Date of Federal Council's decision on crisis management optimization"
    },
    {
      "type": "claim",
      "quote": "On 29 March 2023, the Federal Council took a landmark decision on optimising its crisis management at a time of increasing global uncertainty.",
      "gist": "Federal Council made a significant decision to optimize crisis management on March 29, 2023, amid growing global uncertainty."
    },
    {
      "type": "claim",
      "quote": "The focus is on managing emerging crises within the existing structures of the Federal Administration for as long as possible, but with accelerated procedures to increase efficiency.",
      "gist": "Crisis management focuses on using existing Federal Administration structures as long as possible, with faster procedures to boost efficiency."
    },
    {
      "type": "claim",
      "quote": "In addition, the early detection of crises is to be strengthened in order to be able to react to changes in the situation in a timely manner.",
      "gist": "Early crisis detection will be enhanced to enable timely response to changing situations."
    }
  ]
